## Git policy

Inherits from `~/CLAUDE.md` and `~/GitHub/.claude/policies/cross_repo_commits.md`.

- Plain English commits. Present tense. No AI attribution.
- One commit per logical change.
- Never `--no-verify`. Never `--force` to main.

## Cross-repo work

When work in this repo is part of a multi-repo refactor:

1. Use the same branch name across affected repos.
2. Open one PR per repo with the cross-reference block.
3. Stop on the first failing pre-commit gate.

## Risk

- **Adjacent / Tier ≤ 2:** routine local work is low-risk.
- **Tier 3 (touches money):** every change is medium-to-high risk.
  Verify with `tier-check` and `multi-repo-status` before opening a PR.

